{
  "description": "The sfs spec documents only 200/400/401/500 (plus 409 on some writes) on these operations, and only 200 on GetLock, but the API answers 404 for an object that does not exist, and 410 for a resource pool that is gone. STACKIT's own Terraform provider (stackitcloud/terraform-provider-stackit, stackit/internal/services/sfs, read 2026-11-01) handles http.StatusNotFound as already gone in resourcepool/resource.go (Read, also http.StatusGone; Update; Delete), share/resource.go (Read, Update, Delete), export-policy/resource.go (Read, Delete), project-lock/resource.go (Read) and snapshots/datasource.go (the list). The Go SDK's delete wait handlers (stackit-sdk-go core/wait/waiterhelper.go, services/sfs/v1api/wait/wait.go) poll getResourcePool and getShare until 404 or 410. No source shows a 404 from the single-snapshot operations, or from updateShareExportPolicy, so they aren't patched. No live probe.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#NotFound",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "code": {
            "target": "smithy.api#Integer"
          },
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 404,
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 404
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#Gone",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "code": {
            "target": "smithy.api#Integer"
          },
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 410,
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 410
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#GetResourcePool/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#UpdateResourcePool/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#DeleteResourcePool/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#GetShare/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#UpdateShare/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#DeleteShare/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#GetShareExportPolicy/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#DeleteShareExportPolicy/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#ListResourcePoolSnapshots/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#NotFound"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#GetResourcePool/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.sfs#Gone"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.sfs#GetLock/errors",
      "before": "traits",
